{"title":"Skarnwing","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 61 Frost Dragon that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/skarnwing\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skarnwing?lv=61\">Lv 61</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/skarnwing?lv=64\">Lv 64 <span>24</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skarnwing?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/skarnwing?lv=64\" title=\"Pick level 64\"><td><b>64</b></td><td>483</td><td>39.7</td><td>3,200</td><td class=\"muted\">1,449 · 55.6 · 9,600</td><td>24</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 2 recorded drops, 498 total, 215–283 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×215–283</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-hide\" title=\"Dragon Hide - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/9e2b88dfaf721a2d79c9.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Hide</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonscale-knick\" title=\"Dragonscale Knick - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/620b30f073ef24409e0d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonscale Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragon-fang\" title=\"Dragon Fang - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2688ac9988cad641486e.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragon Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-feet\" title=\"Thorn Feet - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c545c7eb5d27184e604d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thorn Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Frostfang&#39;s Eyrie</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 24</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6501\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Frost Dragon: <a href=\"#/monster/frost-drake\">Frost Drake</a> <span class=\"muted\">(59)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frost-dragon\">Frost Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(61)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elder-frost-dragon\">Elder Frost Dragon</a> <span class=\"muted\">(62)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/mother-hvit\">Mother Hvit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(63)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ysgar\">Ysgar the Elder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(64)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/frostfang\">Frostfang</a> <span class=\"muted\">(66)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/72d6ea37ea311fc96583.svg\" alt=\"Skarnwing\"></div><h3>Skarnwing</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>61 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 64–64)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Frost Dragon</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>462</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>38.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>3050</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2.05</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (10 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}